  {
    "id": "event-4snjks6o5h0akfajg3qhc208fn@google.com",
    "category": "events",
    "timestamp": "2018-02-17T23:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "[Revelation] Bipolar episode, symptoms",
    "detail": {
      "calendar": "Revelation",
      "summary": "Bipolar episode, symptoms",
      "description": "Felt like a vessel was going to burst in my brain\nCouldn't sleep, when I did I woke up stressed, brain flushed with blood\nObsessing over bullying, took it out on cats, thought about how Steve treated me as a child\nThis time I realized, sexual abuse from Nancy, treated poorly by Phil, not compassionate or empathetic\nThis time, missed turns driving, getting upset, general confusion and people scare me while driving\nTrying to fix homelessness, gave a homeless guy a hug and an Apple\nWorried about bad drivers running over Iga and my unborn child\nThis time, thought every radio station was playing Christian rock\nThought all music was speaking to me personally\nRadio station playing multiple songs overlapping and then cut out\nHad exact amount of money we needed, to pay deposit and months rent\nI explained to Cameron big problems I want to solve, told me to focus on my family and pregnant wife, not world problems\nFelt like I could contribute to fixing world problems\nSurprised Cameron when I told him I consult with my dad and mom about where to live, shocked dad uses money to hold power over me, mother thinks I need to be on pharmaceutical drugs\nStarted making friends with Pino again, getting bit less, climbs on to my head and shoulders.\nLast episode, talking to Gale about losing my job.  Eddie Merlot's Jimmy had a girlfriend died from alcohol overdose, Jimmy moved back to Ohio.  Bought a gift card for girlfriend from Enzo, had the same Black and White dress Sasha stole from Iga. \nJaime had a bone marrow donation, cried at Enzo's, afraid he was going to die.  Talked to a black man on the phone about school, found out he had side businesses not just a telemarketer.  Developed compassion for black people because of Jaime's example.\nReached out to friends from college during bipolar episode.  More social networking.  Spamming lots of posts, connecting to lots of fake profiles.\n\nRadical changes:\nRefuse to cut hair and bear, to look like Jesus\n90% vegetarian\nStop cussing\nPraying at meals more\nMore exercise, opting to walk instead of drive\nNo more smoking weed, stomach feels better, no more bad gas in the morning\nEating more fruits and vegetables\nStarted dreaming more",
      "location": "",
      "start": "2018-02-17T23:00:00.000Z",
      "end": "2018-02-18T00:00:00.000Z",
      "isPublic": true
    }
  },
